\n\nσ = sqrt(Σ(x - 22.222)^2 / 18) ≈ 12.000\n\nNext, let's calculate the standard sample deviation (s) of the green numbers. The formula for the standard sample deviation is:\n\ns = sqrt(Σ(x - μ)^2 / (N - 1))\n\nWhere:\n- x is each value in the dataset\n- μ is the mean of the dataset\n- N is the number of values in the dataset\n\nLet's calculate the mean of the green numbers:\n\nMean = (64 + 73 + 72 + 68 + 47 + 60 + 53 + 59 + 64 + 40 + 74 + 72 + 65 + 76 + 40 + 75 + 26 + 48 + 27 + 34 + 37 + 62 + 31 + 55 + 70 + 31 + 44 + 24 + 64 + 51 + 65 + 38 + 55 + 46 + 78 + 66 + 35 + 76 + 61 + 76 + 41 + 53 + 77 + 51 + 49) / 36 ≈ 58.333\n\nNow, let's calculate the standard sample deviation:\n\ns = sqrt(Σ(x - 58.333)^2 / (36 - 1)) ≈ 10.000\n\nFinally, let's take the average of σ and s:\n\nAverage = (σ + s) / 2 = (12.000 + 10.000) / 2 = 11.000\n\nRounded to the nearest three decimal points, the result is:\n\nFINAL ANSWER: 11.000", "start_time": 1784816117.6377354, "time_record": {"get_size_bytes": 0, "get_time": 0.0, "put_size_bytes": 0}}}, "finished_at_ms": 1784816118705, "inference_records": [{"attempt": 1, "call_index": 1, "duration_ms": 85526, "engine_queue_depth": 0, "error_code": null, "input_tokens": 434, "instance_generation": 1, "instance_id": "model_instance_2666ad642fd44aa5b50095e8cf3f72a6", "instance_placement_lease_id": "lease_6def926fcb45487fb527cc371e4b7660", "model_id": "qwen2_5-vl-3b-smoke", "output_tokens": 885, "prefix_cache_hit": false, "route_lease_id": "route_58dea8efd98248f29b1108a31b23852b", "run_id": "run_79ee78bf4765474883bd295b55532e1b", "started_at_ms": 2610468442, "status": "succeeded", "task_id": "task_1b51aa3d589875f840a8d11a", "ttft_ms": null}], "latency_metrics": {"client_e2e_minus_model_ms": 3659, "client_e2e_ms": 89185, "client_prepare_submission_ms": 25, "client_prepare_trace": {"code_package_ms": 0, "compile_or_resolve_ms": 0, "contract_ms": 1, "input_identity_ms": 0, "input_signature_ms": 0, "input_staging_ms": 23, "input_validation_ms": 0, "optio